{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In aim mode you must click the balls without missing too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In strategy mode you don't have to aim, but you must plan your upgrades carefully. Each time you buy, all upgrades get more expensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Complete the objectives and get to tier 10. You win if you have enough money. Prestige if you need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >META PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn progression points after each level. Buy upgrades that carry over to future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an incremental game with a quick timer so you must optimize your build instead of just waiting until you win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No auto clicker required. Accuracy is more important than speed, so you won\u2019t hurt your wrist playing this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades make you more money, but you must be strategic since each time you buy they get more expensive. If you buy random stuff you won\u2019t be able to increase your earning potential before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinding for meta progression only works when playing on the easiest difficulty level. At higher difficulties progress doesn't carry over between runs.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strategy Mode: Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/e4f30781473e8d6e84d6a33cfab25ae2f64ba8dc.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/056e614a8bee5884990b319ba3b201debe4508d3.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Hard II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/52a9d7ad9d0f11c96067bac45939227afaec0c96.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Hard II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/ebda0161ac3ff781abb9470f118976e9520c976e.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/62c8a24fd136d1bd2d6a38f01face96c6185baf6.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/b5ded4cc5baef0c41cb445a5353335a60bb9a934.jpg"},{"name":"Strategy Mode: Maximum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/691114a20adfa8d2ee0a066f545cb195481fed7f.jpg"},{"name":"Aim Mode: Maximum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665640/8270f03956c25a46f9efa199260b0346721eb67c.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1763627139","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1763627139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/7ee65c60181e0dc092cc85f5a0cac4ae1814e3b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763627139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/7ee65c60181e0dc092cc85f5a0cac4ae1814e3b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763627139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/028fd075fd2676296893ec4321d20d1e.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In aim mode you must click the balls without missing too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In strategy mode you don't have to aim, but you must plan your upgrades carefully. Each time you buy, all upgrades get more expensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/d0ccd0b31e35b82f48b604da04635217.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Complete the objectives and get to tier 10. You win if you have enough money. Prestige if you need more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >META PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.poster.avif?t=1763627139\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.webm?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/2c67b82b0788e2b75a22563d549119b2.mp4?t=1763627139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn progression points after each level. Buy upgrades that carry over to future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an incremental game with a quick timer so you must optimize your build instead of just waiting until you win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No auto clicker required. Accuracy is more important than speed, so you won\u2019t hurt your wrist playing this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades make you more money, but you must be strategic since each time you buy they get more expensive. If you buy random stuff you won\u2019t be able to increase your earning potential before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinding for meta progression only works when playing on the easiest difficulty level. At higher difficulties progress doesn't carry over between runs.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bergeronimo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/9ff8b8a5552a42ede621443db108d112f0caed3c/header.jpg?t=1763627139","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665640/56860240/afd509e9a0c5cecaae248a399d7ce32b6159ab57/1763445364/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763456362","dash_h264"